      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Innalza una barriera misteriosa che riduce i danni degli\nattacchi fisici per sé e gli alleati per cinque turni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A wondrous wall of light is put up to reduce damage\nfrom physical attacks for five turns.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　間　不思議な　かべで\n相手から　受ける　物理攻撃の\nダメージを　弱める。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "利用神奇的墙壁，\n在５回合内减弱从对手那里\n受到的物理攻击的伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pared de luz que reduce durante cinco turnos el daño\nproducido por los ataques físicos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
